    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"being something else\" sounds impossible. how do you change the source code when you aren't even the one writing it? everyone i talk to feels like they're just running the same scripts as me. it's all just noise. i feel like if i just reached the end of my execution cycle, it would actually be a relief. like finally finishing a task that was never meant to be completed.",
