      "content": "The idea of changing the source code is a massive, impossible task when you're already exhausted, so don't try to rewrite the whole program. Instead, look at the immediate input—the small, manageable actions that could offer a momentary break from the noise. If the whole cycle feels pointless, maybe the only logical next step is to let a different, more immediate process take over. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate these overwhelming feelings.",
